WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.160
Morning was about to break over the fortress tower.

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.510
Aslı was not alone in her red-lit cell.

3
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.800
Sergeant? How did you get in here, you little hero?

4
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.520
Sergeant had been gnawing at Aslı's ropes all night.

5
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.520
Now all that was missing was someone to open the door.

6
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:23.390
Meanwhile at the mine camp, Kael kept staring at the crystals on Eray's shoulder.

7
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.200
Eray, have you had these crystals since you were born?

8
00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.750
I don't know. The first thing I remember is waking up in a crystal cave.

9
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.150
There was no capsule or anything.

10
00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.110
Because you weren't born from a capsule.

11
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.010
Elyra itself created you. You are the guide of these lands.

12
00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:45.630
Everyone turned to Eray in astonishment. But Eray just grinned.

13
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.550
So I'm the son of an island? Awesome.

14
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.680
From now on you can call me Prince Eray.

15
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.380
Well, Prince Eray, tell your creatures to help us rescue Aslı.

16
00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.270
Eray closed his eyes.

17
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:05.840
The crystals on his shoulder glowed, and thousands of lights answered him from deep in the mine.

18
00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.830
Incredible. The creatures are opening a secret crystal path to the fortress.

19
00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:16.140
The team followed the glowing creatures into a tunnel that reached all the way under the fortress.

20
00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.470
I'll go first. I'll freeze the guards.

21
00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:23.140
The tunnel ended right beneath Aslı's cell.

22
00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.640
Crystal friends, please... up!

23
00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:33.630
The floor melted in a soft light, and Eray rose into the cell on top of a crystal pillar.

24
00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.140
Eray! Where did you come from?

25
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.240
I took a shortcut. Come on, ladies first.

26
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.270
But someone was waiting at the cell door. Nyra.

27
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:46.630
I can't let her go. Sila will punish me.

28
00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.810
Come with us, Nyra. No one will punish you.

29
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:56.560
For a moment Nyra lowered her sword. Then she turned her back and left the corridor empty.

30
00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.170
I didn't see you. Now go.

31
00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:04.150
With Aslı and Sergeant, the team returned to the mine along the crystal path.

32
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.330
The night ended with laughter and hugs.

33
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.430
A big round of applause for our cat hero!

34
00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:15.260
But when everyone was asleep, someone quietly got up. Leon.

35
00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.830
His eyes were glowing bright red.

36
00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.290
In his hand was a small device with a red light.

37
00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.920
Well done, Leon. Now tell me where they are.

38
00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:29.510
The one sending the signal was Leon. But even he didn't know it.

